sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as App (React)
    participant G as Open-Meteo Geocoding API
    participant F as Open-Meteo Forecast API

    U->>A: submit city name
    A->>A: status = loading
    A->>G: GET /v1/search?name=<city>&count=1
    alt geocode returns no results
        G-->>A: { results: null }
        A->>U: error "City not found" (status = error)
    else geocode succeeds
        G-->>A: results[0]: name, lat, lon, admin1, country
        A->>F: GET /v1/forecast?lat..&lon..&current=..&daily=..&timezone=auto
        alt forecast fetch fails
            F-->>A: network / HTTP error
            A->>U: error "Something went wrong" (status = error)
        else forecast succeeds
            F-->>A: current + daily JSON
            A->>A: status = success
            A->>U: render current conditions + 7-day forecast
        end
    end
